%% Simulation with data in and out: A simulation that takes data as input and produces data as output. Input and output assignments are parts of the simulation that say which data goes in and which comes out, because data cannot have roles in BFO.

    Simulation["<b>Simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::local
    InputData["<b>Input data</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity"]:::local
    OutputData["<b>Output data</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity"]:::local
    InputAssignment["<b>Input assignment</b><br>PMD_0000066 input assignment"]:::local
    OutputAssignment["<b>Output assignment</b><br>PMD_0000067 output assignment"]:::local

    Simulation -. "has specified input<br>OBI_0000293" .-> InputData
    Simulation -. "has specified output<br>OBI_0000299" .-> OutputData
    InputAssignment -. "part of<br>BFO_0000050" .-> Simulation
    InputAssignment -. "has participant<br>RO_0000057" .-> InputData
    OutputAssignment -. "part of<br>BFO_0000050" .-> Simulation
    OutputAssignment -. "has participant<br>RO_0000057" .-> OutputData

    classDef local fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a

